#: inc/helpers.php:233
msgid ""
"Dastaan by Artisans is a Navi Mumbai based studio sourcing luxury unstitched dress material directly from master artisans across India. Every set — kurta fabric, dupatta and bottom — is crafted in pure organza silk, mul chanderi, viscose georgette, linen or tussar silk, and finished with genuine hand embroidery: Lucknowi chikankari, zardozi and dabka, gota patti, mukaish, pitta and jaali work.\n"
"\n"
"Because our pieces are unstitched, you choose the silhouette: anarkali, straight kurta set, sharara or co-ord. Prices range from ₹5,000 to ₹25,000, reflecting the hours of handwork in each piece. Most designs are limited to one or two sets, so what you wear stays uniquely yours."
msgstr ""

#: inc/helpers.php:234
msgid "What does an unstitched dress material set include?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/helpers.php:235
msgid "Most Dastaan sets are three pieces: kurta fabric (approx. 3.25 m), dupatta (approx. 2.75 m) and bottom fabric (approx. 2.5 m). Exact lengths and contents are listed on each product page."
msgstr ""

#: inc/helpers.php:236
msgid "Do you offer stitching or tailoring?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/helpers.php:237
msgid "We sell unstitched fabric so you can tailor it to your silhouette. On request, our studio in Seawoods can recommend trusted tailors and share a stitching guide on WhatsApp."
msgstr ""

#: inc/helpers.php:238
msgid "How should I care for hand-embroidered fabric?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/helpers.php:239
msgid "Dry clean only for zardozi, dabka, mukaish and sequin work. Fine chikankari on mul or chanderi may be gently hand-washed in cold water. Always store folded in muslin, away from direct sunlight."
msgstr ""

#: inc/helpers.php:240
msgid "What is your exchange policy?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/helpers.php:241
msgid "Exchanges are accepted within 48 hours of delivery for unused, uncut fabric with tags intact. Because every piece is handcrafted, slight variations in embroidery are natural and not considered defects."
msgstr ""

#: inc/helpers.php:244
msgid "An artisan-source studio in Seawoods, Navi Mumbai. We bring handcrafted unstitched dress material from master karigars to women who value real craft."
msgstr ""

